Bind Npc 16094 Zone 31

On greeting
    Say "Do you want to exit from here?"
    Topic "Yes. I want to leave." goto leave_bifrost
    Topic "No. I don't want to leave." goto close
    Goto close

On leave_bifrost
    If player level < 30
        If player is Karus
            Teleport 1 at 441 1625
        Else
            Teleport 2 at 1595 412
    Else
        If player is Karus
            Teleport 71 at 1014 1020
        Else
            Teleport 71 at 1026 984
